# Check a goal without starting a flight. A zero tolerance checks the exact goal only.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped goal
float32 tolerance
---
# Empty if neither the requested goal nor a frontier can be reached.
nav_msgs/Path plan
# Why the requested goal failed, even when the plan leads to a frontier.
string rejection_reason
# Why searching for a frontier did not produce an alternative.
string frontier_status
